   "fen": "rnb1kb1r/pp2pppp/1Q3n2/3p4/3p1B2/2P5/PP1NPPPP/R3KBNR b KQkq - 0 6",
   "line": [
    "Qb3",
    "cxd4",
    "Qxb6"
   ],
   "spoken": "If the queen goes to b3, take on d4, forcing White to grab the queen or lose the d-pawn."
